{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008810/extras/d29721daaa98d9ef3bc220fdb7cfefb8.avif?t=1757685801\" width=1560 height=353 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Insurrectionist is a Story-Rich RPG where you control Mia, a mercenary forced to survive in a dystopian, hateful world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, she stumbles upon a mysterious man who appears to be suffering from amnesia. No one knows how he lost his memories, though he does appear to be important, somehow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Insurrectionist Demo includes a small amount of the full game's content intended to give players a taste of its mechanics and gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008810/extras/692082c0769984a9c9d7ff9a926d3a68.avif?t=1757685801\" width=367 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo has various features such as:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 50-60 minutes of gameplay and exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A day and night cycle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 2 playable party members.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 2 unique boss fights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- The overworld map along with 2 of its numerous zones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 9 different equippable Traits.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4008810?t=1757685801","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4008810?t=1757685801","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008810/cce597828e2c985c672abdb775410825175aaf44/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757685801","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008810/cce597828e2c985c672abdb775410825175aaf44/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757685801","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008810/extras/d29721daaa98d9ef3bc220fdb7cfefb8.avif?t=1757685801\" width=1560 height=353 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Insurrectionist is a Story-Rich RPG where you control Mia, a mercenary forced to survive in a dystopian, hateful world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, she stumbles upon a mysterious man who appears to be suffering from amnesia. No one knows how he lost his memories, though he does appear to be important, somehow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Insurrectionist Demo includes a small amount of the full game's content intended to give players a taste of its mechanics and gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008810/extras/692082c0769984a9c9d7ff9a926d3a68.avif?t=1757685801\" width=367 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo has various features such as:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 50-60 minutes of gameplay and exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A day and night cycle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 2 playable party members.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 2 unique boss fights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- The overworld map along with 2 of its numerous zones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 9 different equippable Traits.</p>","developers":["Abihumsi"],"fullgame":{"appid":"4008190","name":"Insurrectionist"},"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description"